Output demo.mp4
Output demo.ascii

Set Shell pwsh
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 2000
Set Height 600

Sleep 3s

Type "Install-Module PwshSpectreConsole -Scope CurrentUser -Force" Sleep 500ms Enter

Wait

Type 'Get-SpectreImage "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/PowerShell_5.0_icon.png" -MaxWidth 15' Sleep 500ms Enter

Sleep 5s